# TypeOK pairing: a submitted write carries an origin outside the model.
MODULE: TypeOKSubmitUndeclaredOrigin
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a write arrives with an undeclared origin
PERTURBS: Submit

--- FIND
    /\ phase' = "Submitted" /\ origin' = o /\ atomic' = a /\ req' = r /\ val' = r[1]
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase' = "Submitted" /\ origin' = "Peer" /\ atomic' = a /\ req' = r /\ val' = r[1]
--- END
